      {
        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Keep Only the Long Lines\n\nFilters a list down to the lines longer than 10 characters and counts them. It shows how to turn a list into a stream and back into a list.\n\n**How it works:** \"Lines\" holds four strings. \"Fan out\" sends them one at a time to \"Longer than 10\", which keeps items that pass its predicate. \"Gather\" collects the survivors into a list for the \"kept\" output, and \"How many\" counts them for the \"count\" output.\n\n**Try this:** Change the predicate on \"Longer than 10\" to item.length > 3 and watch both outputs change."
        },
